        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DKV630, Solid Brass Door Knocker With Viewer</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis viewer door knocker includes a 180 degree glass lens viewer for a less obvious way to add security to your home. Now you can safely see who is at your door before you open it. The glass viewer (peephole)  has a 1/2\" diameter shaft. This Deltana made Door Knocker With Viewer is made of solid brass. It is thru-bolt mounted with  3-3/4\" center to center mounting holes (distance between the 2 mounting bolt holes). Includes 2 matching finish #10 2\" long screws with 5/8\" diameter decorative screw bezels for easy installation. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DKV630-Specifcations.gif?v=1704354497\" width=\"420\" height=\"293\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana DKV630 Viewer Door Knocker Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana DKV630 Peep Hole Door Knocker:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 5-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 3-3/4\" c.c.  (distance between the 2 mounting screw holes)</li>\r\n<li>Max Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting: Thru-Bolted (Screws go thru the door)</li>\r\n<li>Includes matching finish mounting hardware and eye viewer.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DKV630.pdf?v=1704262193\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DKV630 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Viewer Door Knocker, Deltana DKV630",
                "description": "Solid Brass Viewer Door Knocker Deltana DKV630 - This viewer door knocker includes a 180 degree glass lens viewer. Now you can safely see who is at your door before you open it. The glass viewer (peephole)  has a 1/2 inch diameter shaft. This Deltana made Door Knocker With Viewer is made of solid brass. It is available in 9 great finishes. It is thru-bolt mounted with  3-3/4 inch center to center mounting holes (distance between the 2 mounting bolt holes). Includes 2 matching finish 2 inch long screws with 5/8 inch diameter decorative screw bezels for easy installation. ",
                "keywords": "DEL-DKV630 Door Knocker with Viewers, Deltana DKV630 Solid Brass Viewer Door Knockers, sight glass, glass lens, peepholes, peek holes, peep holes, Deltana eye viewer door knockers, urn tip door knockers, classic door knockers, traditional door knockers, Peep Hole Door Knockers,"
